repository-code: "https://github.com/Codar-Sistemas/hospitais-referencia-api"
url: "https://hospitais-referencia-api.vercel.app"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Public, free REST API that normalises and republishes Brazilian Ministry
  of Health hospital data (animais peçonhentos vertical in production;
  doenças raras and oncologia in development), built on a serverless
  architecture with an LLM-based extraction pipeline (Gemini → Groq →
  Tesseract fallback chain) that bridges the gap between government PDF
  publications and machine-readable health-system data.
keywords:
  - public-health
  - SUS
